      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਬਖਾਨੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107714",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਪਹਿਚਾਨੋ ॥੭੫੦॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh pahichaano ||750||",
      "translation": "Saying the words “Mrigi-aadhip” and then adding the words “Pati” and “Shatru”, recognize thus all the names of tupak.750.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੭੫੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सभ पहिचानो ॥७५०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107715",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀਰਾਟ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਭਨਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "mirageeraaT sabadhaadh bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀਰਾਟ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मृगीराट सबदादि भनिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107716",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਪਾਛੇ ਪਤਿ ਪਦ ਕਹੁ ਦਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa paachhe pat padh kahu dhijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਪਤਿ' ਪਦ ਨੂੰ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता पाछे पति पद कहु दिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107717",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0020",
      "lineIndex": 20,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko a(n)t uchaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को अंति उचारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107718",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0021",
      "lineIndex": 21,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਜੀਅ ਧਾਰੋ ॥੭੫੧॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh jeea dhaaro ||751||",
      "translation": "Utter firstly the words Mrigi-raat” and then say “Pati Shatru”, thus comprehend the names of tupak.751.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੭੫੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सभ जीअ धारो ॥७५१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107719",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0022",
      "lineIndex": 22,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "miragee i(n)dhr sabadhaadh bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਇੰਦ੍ਰ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਆਦਿ ਸ਼ੁਰੂ ਵਿਚ ਰਖੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मृगी इंद्र सबदादि बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107720",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0023",
      "lineIndex": 23,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਪਾਛੇ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਠਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa paachhe naik padh Thaano ||",
      "translation": "Utter firstly the words “Mrigi-Indra” and add the word “Nayak”",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता पाछे नाइक पद ठानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107721",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0024",
      "lineIndex": 24,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਪਾਛੇ ਰਿਪੁ ਸਬਦ ਭਨੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa paachhe rip sabadh bhaneejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਰਿਪੁ' ਪਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता पाछे रिपु सबद भनीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107722",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0025",
      "lineIndex": 25,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਚੀਨ ਚਿਤਿ ਲੀਜੈ ॥੭੫੨॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tufa(n)g cheen chit leejai ||752||",
      "translation": "After that speaking the word “Ripu”, recognize all the names of Tupak.752.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੭੫੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुफंग चीन चिति लीजै ॥७५२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107723",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਏਸਰ ਕੋ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "miragee esar ko aadh uchareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਏਸਰ' (ਹਿਰਨ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਪਹਿਲਾ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मृगी एसर को आदि उचरीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107724",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਪਾਛੇ ਪਤਿ ਪਦ ਦੇ ਡਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa paachhe pat padh dhe ddareeaai ||",
      "translation": "Utter firstly the word “Mrigeshwar”, speak words “Pati Shatru”",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਪਤਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता पाछे पति पद दे डरीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107725",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko a(n)t bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੰਤ ਵਿਚ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਰਖੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को अंति बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107726",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਸਕਲ ਪਹਿਚਾਨੋ ॥੭੫੩॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tufa(n)g sakal pahichaano ||753||",
      "translation": "Then recognise all the names of Tupak.753.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੭੫੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुफंग सकल पहिचानो ॥७५३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107727",
      "sourceShabadId": "9510",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅੜਿਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aRil ||",
      "translation": "ARIL",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੜਿਲ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अड़िल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107728",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀਰਾਜ ਕੋ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "mirageeraaj ko aadh uchaaran keejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀਰਾਜ' (ਸ਼ੇਰ) (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਦਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मृगीराज को आदि उचारन कीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107729",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਕੇ ਪਾਛੇ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਕਹਿ ਦੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa ke paachhe naik padh keh dheejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਪਿਛੋਂ 'ਨਾਇਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਜੋੜ ਦਿਓ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता के पाछे नाइक पद कहि दीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107730",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਯੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko taa ke a(n)t bakhaaneeyo ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को ता के अंति बखानीयो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107731",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੈ ਸਕਲ ਚਤੁਰ ਪਹਿਚਾਨੀਯੋ ॥੭੫੪॥",
      "transliteration": "ho naam tupak kai sakal chatur pahichaaneeyo ||754||",
      "translation": "Saying firstly the word “Mrigiraaj”, then uttering the word “Nayak” and then adding the word “Shatru” at the end, O wise persons! reocognise all the names of Tupak.754.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਭ ਚਤੁਰ ਪੁਰਸ਼ ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੭੫੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो नाम तुपक कै सकल चतुर पहिचानीयो ॥७५४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107732",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗਿਜ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਮੁਖ ਤੇ ਆਦਿ ਬਖਾਨੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "miragij sabadh ko mukh te aadh bakhaaneeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮ੍ਰਿਗਿਜ' (ਹਿਰਨੀ ਦਾ ਬੱਚਾ, ਹਿਰਨ) ਨੂੰ ਮੁਖ ਤੋਂ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मृगिज सबद को मुख ते आदि बखानीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107733",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਕੇ ਪਾਛੇ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਕੋ ਠਾਨੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa ke paachhe naik padh ko Thaaneeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता के पाछे नाइक पद को ठानीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107734",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko taa ke a(n)t uchaareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को ता के अंति उचारीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107735",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਭ ਹੀ ਚਤੁਰ ਬਿਚਾਰੀਐ ॥੭੫੫॥",
      "transliteration": "ho naam tupak ke sabh hee chatur bichaareeaai ||755||",
      "translation": "Saying the word “Mrigaj” in the beginning and then uttering the words “Nayak” and “Shatru”, O wise men! comprehend the names of Tupak.755.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਾਰੇ ਸੂਝਵਾਨ ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੭੫੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो नाम तुपक के सभ ही चतुर बिचारीऐ ॥७५५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107736",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੁਖ ਤੇ ਪ੍ਰਥਮ ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਸੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਭਾਖੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "mukh te pratham miragee su sabadh ko bhaakheeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮੁਖ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मुख ते प्रथम मृगी सु सबद को भाखीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107737",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਕੇ ਪਾਛੇ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਕੋ ਰਾਖੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa ke paachhe naik padh ko raakheeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) ਉਸ ਪਿਛੋਂ 'ਨਾਇਕ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਰਖੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता के पाछे नाइक पद को राखीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107738",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko taa ke a(n)t uchaareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को ता के अंति उचारीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107739",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਚਤੁਰ ਚਿਤਿ ਧਾਰੀਐ ॥੭੫੬॥",
      "transliteration": "ho naam tupak ke sakal chatur chit dhaareeaai ||756||",
      "translation": "Putting firstly the word “Mrigi”, the word “Nayak” and after-wards adding the word “Shatru”, all the names of Tupak are comprehended in mind.756.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸਭ ਚਤੁਰ ਲੋਗ (ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝ ਲੈਣ ॥੭੫੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो नाम तुपक के सकल चतुर चिति धारीऐ ॥७५६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107740",
      "sourceShabadId": "9511",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚੌਪਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chauapiee ||",
      "translation": "CHAUPAI",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚੌਪਈ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चौपई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107741",
      "sourceShabadId": "9512",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਅਨੁਜ ਕੋ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "miragee anuj ko aadh uchaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਅਨੁਜ' (ਹਿਰਨੀ ਦਾ ਛੋਟਾ ਭਰਾ) (ਸ਼ਬਦ) ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मृगी अनुज को आदि उचारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107742",
      "sourceShabadId": "9512",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਾ ਪਾਛੇ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਡਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "taa paachhe naik padh ddaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ता पाछे नाइक पद डारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107743",
      "sourceShabadId": "9512",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur pramaanahu ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि प्रमानहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107744",
      "sourceShabadId": "9512",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਸਕਲ ਜੀਅ ਜਾਨਹੁ ॥੭੫੭॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tufa(n)g sakal jeea jaanahu ||757||",
      "translation": "Putting firstly “Mrigi-anuj” and afterwards adding the words “Nayak” and “Shatru”, all the names of Tupak are known.757.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਨੂੰ ਸਭ ਲੋਗ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਸਮਝੋ ॥੭੫੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुफंग सकल जीअ जानहु ॥७५७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107745",
      "sourceShabadId": "9512",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0755_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਅਨੁਜ ਕੋ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "miragee anuj ko aadh uchaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮ੍ਰਿਗੀ ਅਨੁਜ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 755,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मृगी अनुज को आदि उचारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107746",
      "sourceShabadId": "9512",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    }
  ]
}
